# Documentation
Documentation = Documentation
TableOfContents = Table of Contents
DocIntroduction = Introduction
DocIntroductionText = DolicraftAllo is a Dolibarr module that integrates the Allo cloud phone platform. It enables contact synchronization, call history viewing, SMS sending and real-time webhook notifications.
DocFeatureCallLog = Complete call history with automatic synchronization
DocFeatureSMS = Send SMS from third-party, contact and invoice cards
DocFeatureContacts = Bidirectional contact sync between Allo and Dolibarr
DocFeatureWebhooks = Real-time webhook reception (calls, SMS, contacts)
DocFeatureDashboard = Dashboard with statistics and charts
DocPrerequisites = Prerequisites
DocPrereqAlloPlan = An Allo Business or Pro subscription is required to access the API
DocPrereqApiKey = An API key generated from your Allo account (Settings > API)
DocPrereqDolibarr = Dolibarr version 16 or higher
DocInstallation = Installation
DocInstallStep1 = Copy the dolicraftallo folder into Dolibarr's custom/ directory
DocInstallStep2 = Activate the module from Home > Setup > Modules
DocInstallStep3 = Configure the API key in the module's Configuration tab
DocConfiguration = Configuration
DocConfigurationText = Go to the Configuration tab to set up the module.
DocConfigApiKey = Your Allo API key, available in Settings > API of your Allo account
DocConfigNumbers = Add your Allo numbers in the Numbers tab. You can assign a number to a specific user.
DocConfigWebhook = The webhook URL to configure in your Allo account to receive real-time events
DocConfigSenderId = Alphanumeric sender ID (3-11 characters) for sending SMS in France
DocCallLog = Call Log
DocCallLogText = The call log displays all calls synchronized from your Allo account.
DocCallLogSync = Click "Sync calls" to fetch the latest calls from Allo
DocCallLogFilter = Use filters to search by date, number, call type or Allo number
DocCallLogTranscript = If available, the call transcript is accessible via the icon in the Transcript column
DocCallLogRecording = Audio recordings are accessible via the play icon in the Summary column
DocSMS = SMS
DocSMSText = The module allows sending SMS directly from Dolibarr.
DocSMSSend = Send SMS from third-party, contact and invoice cards via the "Send SMS" button
DocSMSTemplates = Create reusable SMS templates in the SMS Templates tab with dynamic variables
DocSMSInbox = View received SMS in the inbox (Inbox tab)
DocSMSLog = The complete SMS history (sent and received) is available in the SMS tab
DocContacts = Contacts
DocContactsText = Contact synchronization links your Allo contacts to your Dolibarr contacts.
DocContactsSync = Synchronization uses phone numbers to match between Allo and Dolibarr
DocContactsMap = Mapped contacts are displayed with their Dolibarr correspondence (third-party and contact)
DocContactsCreate = If no matching Dolibarr contact is found, a new contact is automatically created during synchronization
DocWebhooks = Webhooks
DocWebhooksText = Webhooks allow Allo to send real-time notifications to Dolibarr.
DocWebhooksEvents = Supported events:
DocWebhookEventCall = Call completed - automatically logged in the call log
DocWebhookEventSMS = SMS received - logged in the inbox and SMS log
DocWebhookEventContact = Contact updated - mapping is automatically updated
DocDashboard = Dashboard
DocDashboardText = The dashboard provides an overview of your phone activity.
DocDashboardCalls = Total calls, missed calls, average duration
DocDashboardSMS = SMS sent and received, response rate
DocDashboardContacts = Active contacts and top contacts by call count
DocTroubleshooting = Troubleshooting
DocTroubleshootConnectionFail = API connection fails
DocTroubleshootConnectionFixe = Check that your API key is correct and your Allo subscription is active. Test the connection via the button in the Configuration tab.
DocTroubleshootNoCallsSync = No calls are synchronized
DocTroubleshootNoCallsFix = Check that at least one Allo number is configured in the Numbers tab. Also verify that calls exist on your Allo account.
DocTroubleshootSMSFail = SMS sending fails
DocTroubleshootSMSFix = Check that SMS sending is enabled in the configuration. Verify the Sender ID for France. Make sure the destination number is in international format.
DocTroubleshootWebhookFail = Webhooks are not working
DocTroubleshootWebhookFix = Check the webhook URL in your Allo account. The URL must be publicly accessible (HTTPS recommended). Check Dolibarr logs for any errors.

